#. module: pos_payment_method_fee
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_payment_method_fee.field_pos_payment_method_fee__posting_policy
msgid ""
"Immediate: the accounting entry is generated right after the payment is registered.\n"
"At Session Close: the fee is calculated immediately but the accounting entry is generated (and optionally grouped) when the POS session is closed."
msgstr ""
"Inmediata: el asiento contable se genera justo después de registrar el pago.\n"
"Al cierre de sesión: la comisión se calcula inmediatamente pero el asiento contable se genera (y opcionalmente agrupa) al cerrar la sesión TPV."

